Future Enhancements

Future improvements may include:

Automatic production lifecycle updates after deployment
Automated cleanup of legacy Production lifecycle assignments
Standardized Azure DevOps templates for all application teams
Centralized governance to validate Production lifecycle assignments
Recommendation

Following evaluation of the available approaches, the recommended solution is to standardize a single production branch per application and use that branch as the authoritative Production target within Snyk.

Release branches should continue to be scanned for pre-production validation, while the production branch serves as the sole source for Production lifecycle assignment and reporting.
